{"data":[{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2086673057360609356","created_at":"2026-08-10T04:36:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2086673057360609356"],"id":"2086673057360609356","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":23510,"like_count":276,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":61,"retweet_count":40},"text":"【关系申请】申请和你建立杯子关系","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2086673057360609356"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2086531034687156619","created_at":"2026-08-09T19:12:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2086531034687156619"],"id":"2086531034687156619","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":15,"impression_count":31316,"like_count":603,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":79,"retweet_count":58},"text":"我根本就不知道怎么谈恋爱，我也根本就不知道怎么交朋友，每次交朋友都像谈恋爱，每次谈恋爱都像交朋友","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2086531034687156619"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2086530948930437141","created_at":"2026-08-09T19:11:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2086530948930437141"],"id":"2086530948930437141","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":5661,"like_count":41,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":45,"retweet_count":2},"text":"我要是交友恋爱跟我点外卖一样谨慎就好了，不过我外卖也选得很烂，非常谨慎地踩雷","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2086530948930437141"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2086530632189108725","created_at":"2026-08-09T19:10:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2086530632189108725"],"id":"2086530632189108725","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":5230,"like_count":22,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":44,"retweet_count":0},"text":"每次别人只是说说要送我礼物问我想要什么，这个时候我都会草草说一句我要你开心啊。然后他们也都不会有下一步的动作了，没人还要接着问一句我是真的想送你点什么。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2086530632189108725"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2086403560020000966","created_at":"2026-08-09T10:45:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2086403560020000966"],"id":"2086403560020000966","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":16980,"like_count":153,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":95,"retweet_count":17},"text":"我根本不介意被视奸，因为我的幽默、我的品味和我的生活方式确实值得反复品鉴。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2086403560020000966"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2086325069899522227","created_at":"2026-08-09T05:33:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2086325069899522227"],"id":"2086325069899522227","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":13153,"like_count":139,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":79,"retweet_count":10},"text":"我：求自己闭嘴吧，不要再开莫名其妙的黄色笑话了\n也是我：马上找到对方的关键词，提取出银辉内容。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2086325069899522227"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2086301781970334165","created_at":"2026-08-09T04:01:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2086301781970334165"],"id":"2086301781970334165","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":10274,"like_count":74,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":34,"retweet_count":3},"text":"我对你的爱保质期是野生狗奶","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2086301781970334165"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2086153194762391585","created_at":"2026-08-08T18:10:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2086153194762391585"],"id":"2086153194762391585","lang":"ja","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4524,"like_count":32,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":3},"text":"注意看 这位缺乏睡眠的朋友又在歹毒的熬夜","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2086153194762391585"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2086140696516542949","created_at":"2026-08-08T17:21:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2086140696516542949"],"id":"2086140696516542949","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2286,"like_count":15,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我现在的状态像是一个宅男，无所事事，呆在家里面，打完飞机，然后很空虚，很迷茫，很迷惑","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2086140696516542949"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2086115448844866018","created_at":"2026-08-08T15:40:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2086115448844866018"],"id":"2086115448844866018","lang":"zh","note_tweet":{"text":"从来没有想过会像是正常人一样，拥有正常的、会对另外一个人产生依赖的感情。然而站在阴暗之中久了，就会不自觉地想要追随光。尽管嘴巴上说：\n当个苔藓植物挺开心的，晒什么太阳。\n直到某一天，雪夜里，月光下，她对我说：今晚的月色真好。我推开了窗看了眼，嗯，还真是。于是我回复了她一个”。“句号代表着，迟疑，不愿言语，与不得不回复。\n迟疑，我知道其实以现在的我来说，根本不应该也没有本事回应她的感情，我能照顾好她吗，我能为她遮风挡雨吗？我是否真的是她心目中那样的人？\n总的来说大概就是，很抱歉我是个胆小鬼，不过纵使不情愿，我还是想告诉你：真高兴世界上居然有这么巧合的事，我也喜欢你。"},"public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":4958,"like_count":59,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":3},"text":"从来没有想过会像是正常人一样，拥有正常的、会对另外一个人产生依赖的感情。然而站在阴暗之中久了，就会不自觉地想要追随光。尽管嘴巴上说：\n当个苔藓植物挺开心的，晒什么太阳。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2086115448844866018"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2086091711135306195","created_at":"2026-08-08T14:06:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2086091711135306195"],"id":"2086091711135306195","lang":"zh","note_tweet":{"text":"人最柔软的地方是舍不得\n对这句话越来越有实感\n我十分恋旧\n舍不得忘记过去的点点滴滴\n无论美好的痛苦的破碎的还是不堪\n好的坏的全都塑造成了现在的我\n    \n每次分别浓烈的不舍和痛苦埋没了我\n我从不否定你\n你的出现也许带给我无边的痛苦内疚\n但也让我感受到确切的快乐\n几个酒后的深夜你躺在我的床上\n被窝里两具身体紧紧相拥攀缠\n我把头埋进你下巴和胸腔之间\n一种实体的安全感团团裹住了我\n看你熟睡的侧脸时常不禁落泪\n/\n我们从不提爱 也避免去提到恨\n两个人说过最多的话就是舍不得\n大醉后袒露真心的说一句真的舍不得你\n仿佛恨海情天里东亚人最爱的戏码\n“烂人真心”\n    \n安静的房间里只能听到彼此的呼吸声\n你背对我的时候 会靠近你的后颈\n贪婪地汲取你的气味 我想记住\n关于你的一切我从来都舍不得\n    \n明知道是饮鸠止渴\n也甘之如饴"},"public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":4798,"like_count":42,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":3},"text":"人最柔软的地方是舍不得\n对这句话越来越有实感\n我十分恋旧\n舍不得忘记过去的点点滴滴\n无论美好的痛苦的破碎的还是不堪\n好的坏的全都塑造成了现在的我\n    \n每次分别浓烈的不舍和痛苦埋没了我\n我从不否定你\n你的出现也许带给我无边的痛苦内疚\n但也让我感受到确切的快乐\n几个酒后的深夜你躺在我的床上","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2086091711135306195"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2086041512975229354","created_at":"2026-08-08T10:47:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2086041512975229354"],"id":"2086041512975229354","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":3222,"like_count":28,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":15,"retweet_count":0},"text":"以为装傻就没事了 反耳呢老天专挑傻的整","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2086041512975229354"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2086001547625091534","created_at":"2026-08-08T08:08:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2086001547625091534"],"id":"2086001547625091534","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3347,"like_count":32,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":20,"retweet_count":1},"text":"如果按照我妈从小教育我的电子产品放在床头有辐射，那我大学四年上完应该是变成哥斯拉了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2086001547625091534"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2085773461180350472","created_at":"2026-08-07T17:01:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2085773461180350472"],"id":"2085773461180350472","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":19737,"like_count":123,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":93,"retweet_count":12},"text":"我爱你究竟是表白，还是从现在开始我要虐待你的免责声明，我有点搞不明白了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2085773461180350472"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2085773358335996327","created_at":"2026-08-07T17:01:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2085773358335996327"],"id":"2085773358335996327","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4552,"like_count":27,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":37,"retweet_count":0},"text":"发了人皮扣的照片被前夫评价为丝带痛。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2085773358335996327"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2085773208809079092","created_at":"2026-08-07T17:00:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2085773208809079092"],"id":"2085773208809079092","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2389,"like_count":23,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":2},"text":"健康关系的前提是两个健康的人，我自己已经毁掉了一半","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2085773208809079092"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2085771783890665599","created_at":"2026-08-07T16:55:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2085771783890665599"],"id":"2085771783890665599","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4141,"like_count":28,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":18,"retweet_count":0},"text":"那些天天许愿要分离焦虑的别被我聊到，不然让你们知道什么叫请神容易送神难","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2085771783890665599"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2085770697666707763","created_at":"2026-08-07T16:51:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2085770697666707763"],"id":"2085770697666707763","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":7275,"like_count":46,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":79,"retweet_count":5},"text":"我以前特别喜欢演傻子玩，然后我发现。我好像不用演了。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2085770697666707763"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2085767676870197460","created_at":"2026-08-07T16:39:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2085767676870197460"],"id":"2085767676870197460","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4541,"like_count":34,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":6},"text":"我可以给谁不用动脑地发很多消息，可以和谁说胡话，可以让谁陪我打游戏，可以缠着谁打电话听我唱歌","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2085767676870197460"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2085766987691532353","created_at":"2026-08-07T16:36:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2085766987691532353"],"id":"2085766987691532353","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2379,"like_count":16,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"每一次，每一次我一旦畅想起来我未来会怎么怎么样我的生活就会给我一击重创，把我按在地上告诉我我不配，我不配你配，你配你怎么不弄死我，弄死我啊，废物","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2085766987691532353"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2085766568185594170","created_at":"2026-08-07T16:34:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2085766568185594170"],"id":"2085766568185594170","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2095,"like_count":15,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"该说什么…\n就像坐在一间空屋子里自言自语，一旦闭上嘴就连那点触到墙壁反弹回来的声音都没了。我到底是应该学会滔滔不绝，还是离开这间屋子。\n我真的需要这间屋子吗。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2085766568185594170"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2085675170685927433","created_at":"2026-08-07T10:31:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2085675170685927433"],"id":"2085675170685927433","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3572,"like_count":22,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":0},"text":"kiri是好女孩吗","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2085675170685927433"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2085673711366021205","created_at":"2026-08-07T10:25:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2085673711366021205"],"id":"2085673711366021205","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":3008,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我竟然从曾经让自己感到很痛苦的人身上继承到了一些特质，有时候意识到就会对自己产生空前的厌恶。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2085673711366021205"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2085644037709549995","created_at":"2026-08-07T08:27:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2085644037709549995"],"id":"2085644037709549995","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3902,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":24,"retweet_count":0},"text":"之前我吃进口药每个月光吃药就要花两千多块钱，换了个医生突然给我全开国产的变成药费每个月200多块钱","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2085644037709549995"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2085332720415129616","created_at":"2026-08-06T11:50:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2085332720415129616"],"id":"2085332720415129616","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3948,"like_count":47,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":7},"text":"哪个公狗的鸡把会成为我的许愿柳呢","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2085332720415129616"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"1917047326990094336","name":"kiri","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1917047544313679872/akAJkXe1_normal.jpg","username":"0TwT012","verified":false}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"2086673057360609356","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3juewhrfz48r8lfteloo0b8vd3vtth9","oldest_id":"2085332720415129616","result_count":25}}